--> 5 mins max.
--> 95% of time go with REST, in certain cases use GraphQL. User RPC for internal communication.
--> Do not spend more time and energy on whether it should be PUT vs POST
    --> Most of the time we use GET and POST

Pagination
===========
  1. Page - GET /events?page=2&limit=25  (return results from 26 to 50).
  2. Cursor - GET /events?cursor=123&limit=25 (return 25 results starting at 123).


